<div class="wm">FirstRun<i aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
<h1>Docs that work (literally).</h1>
<p class="lede">Paste a docs URL. Your coding agent runs the quickstart in a clean container, finds the step that breaks, fixes it, and proves the fix.</p>
