<a href="run.html#ex=dbt" data-n="dbt" hidden>dbt + DuckDB<small>A real quickstart</small></a>
<a href="run.html#ex=dagster" data-n="dagster" hidden>Dagster<small>A real quickstart</small></a>
</div>
<div class="cli mono" id="cli"><span class="p">$ </span>pip install git+https://github.com/HighnessAtharva/firstrun
<span class="p">$ </span>firstrun https://docs.getdbt.com/guides/duckdb
<span class="p">$ </span>firstrun pr &lt;run&gt;   <span class="c"># prints the gh commands for the docs PR</span></div>
<p class="cap">Prefer the terminal? You need Docker and a Claude token from <code>claude setup-token</code>.</p>
