141	<h1>Docs that work (literally).</h1>
142	<p class="lede">Paste a docs URL. Your coding agent runs the quickstart in a clean container, finds the step that breaks, fixes it, and proves the fix.</p>
143	<form class="box" id="f" autocomplete="off">
144	<input id="u" type="text" inputmode="url" spellcheck="false" placeholder="Paste your docs URL" aria-label="Docs URL, or the name of a tool">
