181	<p class="eyebrow">The launch film</p>
182	<h2>Break. Fix. Prove.</h2>
183	<p class="lede" style="margin-top:0">One quickstart, one broken step, one proof. 44 seconds.</p>
184	<video controls playsinline preload="metadata" poster="assets/launch-poster.jpg" aria-label="FirstRun launch film, 44 seconds">
185	<source src="assets/firstrun-launch.mp4" type="video/mp4">
186	<a href="assets/firstrun-launch.mp4">Download the launch film (MP4, 6 MB)</a>
187	</video>
188	<p class="cap">Posted on X on Sat Oct 10, 2026. <a href="https://twitter.com/cultist_dev/status/2108828983194206308">See the post</a>. Built solo for neatHack, the neatlogs hackathon, Oct 10 to 12, 2026.</p>
