192	<h2>Read. Run. Prove.</h2>
193	<p class="lede" style="margin-top:0">The same three moves every time.</p>
194	<div class="rrp">
195	<div><figure><img src="assets/step-run.webp" alt="A terminal command, firstrun run with a docs URL, above six numbered quickstart steps in a clean container" width="910" height="510" loading="lazy"></figure><h3>Read</h3><p>Give it a docs URL. FirstRun reads the page and plans one step per command.</p></div>
196	<div><figure><img src="assets/step-3.webp" alt="Six quickstart steps. The first two pass and step 3, run demo, fails for a new developer" width="1060" height="420" loading="lazy"></figure><h3>Run</h3><p>Every step runs in a clean container, like a new developer. The first failure stops the run.</p></div>
197	<div><figure><img src="assets/step-prove.webp" alt="Break, Fix, Prove: step 3 of 6 fails, the docs fix is applied, a second clean container passes 6 of 6 steps" width="980" height="330" loading="lazy"></figure><h3>Prove</h3><p>A fix is not done until a second clean container passes the whole quickstart.</p></div>
198	</div>
