202	<h2>Watch a Real Run.</h2>
203	<p class="lede" style="margin-top:0">Every run ends with a share link. This page replays it: read, plan, run, fix, prove.</p>
204	<div class="watch" id="ex">
205	<a href="run.html#ex=fixture" data-n="fixture">Known-broken fixture<small>A pip pin that cannot install</small></a>
206	<a href="run.html#ex=dbt" data-n="dbt" hidden>dbt + DuckDB<small>A real quickstart</small></a>
207	<a href="run.html#ex=dagster" data-n="dagster" hidden>Dagster<small>A real quickstart</small></a>
208	</div>
209	<div class="cli mono" id="cli"><span class="p">$ </span>pip install git+https://github.com/HighnessAtharva/firstrun
210	<span class="p">$ </span>firstrun https://docs.getdbt.com/guides/duckdb
211	<span class="p">$ </span>firstrun pr &lt;run&gt;   <span class="c"># prints the gh commands for the docs PR</span></div>
212	<p class="cap">Prefer the terminal? You need Docker and a Claude token from <code>claude setup-token</code>.</p>
