222	<header><img class="lg" src="assets/logo-neatlogs.webp" alt="neatlogs logo" width="44" height="44"><h3>neatlogs</h3></header>
223	<p class="job">Traces every run.</p>
224	<p>The planner, executor and verifier show up as spans, so a bad run has a cause you can read.</p>
225	<a class="more" href="https://neatlogs.com">neatlogs.com</a></div>
226	<figure><img src="assets/shot-neatlogs.webp" alt="neatlogs trace of the FirstRun planner: 3 steps in 12 seconds, with the runbook JSON it produced" loading="lazy" width="1300" height="572"><figcaption>The first FirstRun trace, Sat Oct 10.</figcaption></figure>
227	</article>
228	<article class="tool"><div class="txt">
229	<header><img class="lg" src="assets/logo-entire.webp" alt="Entire logo" width="44" height="44"><h3>Entire</h3></header>
230	<p class="job">Records every session.</p>
231	<p>Each commit carries the Claude Code session that wrote it, so any line traces to a prompt.</p>
232	<a class="more" href="https://entire.io">entire.io</a></div>
233	<figure><img src="assets/shot-entire.webp" alt="Entire trails view for the firstrun repository with trail number 1 in Planning" loading="lazy" width="1300" height="484"><figcaption>Trail #1 for the firstrun repo.</figcaption></figure>
234	</article>
235	<article class="tool"><div class="txt">
236	<header><img class="lg" src="assets/logo-cfoai.webp" alt="cfo.ai logo" width="44" height="44"><h3>cfo.ai</h3></header>
237	<p class="job">Turns cost into a plan.</p>
238	<p>The measured cost per run from neatlogs goes to Ari, the cfo.ai agent, which models the pricing.</p>
239	<a class="more" href="https://cfo.ai">cfo.ai</a></div>
240	<figure><img src="assets/shot-cfoai.webp" alt="cfo.ai chat where Ari, the AI CFO, greets Atharva" loading="lazy" width="1100" height="469"><figcaption>Ari, the cfo.ai agent, on day one.</figcaption></figure>
241	</article>
