278	<h2>Atharva Shah</h2>
279	<p>Atharva is a DevRel engineer. He owns developer docs at AccuKnox and works with Altimate AI.</p>
280	<p>A quickstart that breaks without a sound is a docs bug nobody reports. FirstRun is his answer. He built it alone during the hackathon, in public.</p>
